{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Frc6LTVvy01794494690.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國新申領失業金人數增加，續領人數則減少。</p><p></p><p>美國勞工部公布，首次申領失業保險救濟人數，上星期增加9,000人，至20萬，多過市場預期的19.4萬人。持續申領人數則按周減少2萬人，至169.7萬，並少過市場預期的171萬人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:23:54.538205+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T14:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:17:16.560513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:17:18.508968+00:00","content_hash":"8e35bec41b3114acd37fedf32ba1317de499e9197444fb5d4f40eb153f08dd7b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}